// A short text (a text of a capacity, as a join of short literals is)
// that a function gives back through a var of any length, an `if`, a
// loop, or a var's text it was given to add to: its bytes were on the
// function's stack, so it gives a copy (keepStackTexts). It gave a view
// of where they had been: an empty text, another's bytes, or a crash.
// And `if c { "ab" } else { "" }` with no type asked for is a text.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/text_stack.ent | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      [abc] true
// CHECK-NEXT: [HBasic {{[{][{]}}user{{[}][}]}}:{{[{][{]}}password{{[}][}]}}
// CHECK-NEXT: E# user =
// CHECK-NEXT: Esecret password
// CHECK-NEXT: ] [A a
// CHECK-NEXT: ] [HBasic {{[{][{]}}user{{[}][}]}}:{{[{][{]}}password{{[}][}]}}
// CHECK:      [xy] [zw] [lp] []
// CHECK-NEXT: [mut] true
// CHECK-NEXT: [long one] []
